OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a chilly start it will be
OL,6,Fa largely dry day with sunny spells
OL,7,Fand patchy cloud. Perhaps a few
OL,8,Fshowers near the coast, particularly
OL,9,Fin the south.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear spells at first this
OL,12,Fevening, but cloud amounts tend to
OL,13,Fincrease though the night with perhaps
OL,14,Fsome light rain or drizzle in the
OL,15,Fsouth by dawn. Chilly.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA bright start in the north,
OL,18,Fhowever cloudy across the south with
OL,19,Fspells of light rain or drizzle which
OL,20,Fwill move north to reach all parts
OL,21,Fthrough the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
